      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Even if your doctor hasn't mentioned it, please do not self-medicate with pain relievers when taking Xarelto. The risk of bleeding increases with NSAIDs combined with anticoagulants, even with a single dose. Only your doctor who knows your full medical history can safely advise you on whether Advil is appropriate for your situation. It is best to call their office and specifically ask about ibuprofen safety with your current medication.",
      "source": "target",
